#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/simulations_and_experiments/simulating-long-experiments.ipynb:80
msgid ""
"In the interest of simplicity and running time, we consider a SPM with SEI "
"effects leading to linear degradation, with parameter values chosen so that "
"the capacity fades by 20% in just a few cycles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/simulations_and_experiments/simulating-long-experiments.ipynb:-1
msgid "[2]:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/simulations_and_experiments/simulating-long-experiments.ipynb:-1
msgid ""
"parameter_values = pybamm.ParameterValues(\"Mohtat2020\")\n"
"parameter_values.update({\"SEI kinetic rate constant [m.s-1]\": 1e-14})\n"
"spm = pybamm.lithium_ion.SPM({\"SEI\": \"ec reaction limited\"})"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/simulations_and_experiments/simulating-long-experiments.ipynb:103
msgid ""
"We initialize the concentration in each electrode at 100% State of Charge"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/simulations_and_experiments/simulating-long-experiments.ipynb:-1
msgid "[3]:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/simulations_and_experiments/simulating-long-experiments.ipynb:-1
msgid ""
"# Calculate stoichiometries at 100% SOC\n"
"parameter_values.set_initial_stoichiometries(1);"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/simulations_and_experiments/simulating-long-experiments.ipynb:125
msgid ""
"We can now simulate a single CCCV cycle using the ``Experiment`` class (see "
"`this notebook <https://github.com/pybamm-team/PyBaMM/blob/main/docs/source/"
"examples/notebooks/getting_started/tutorial-5-run-experiments.ipynb>`__ for "
"more details)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/simulations_and_experiments/simulating-long-experiments.ipynb:-1
msgid "[4]:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/simulations_and_experiments/simulating-long-experiments.ipynb:-1
msgid ""
"experiment = pybamm.Experiment(\n"
"    [\n"
"        (\n"
"            \"Discharge at 1C until 3V\",\n"
"            \"Rest for 1 hour\",\n"
"            \"Charge at 1C until 4.2V\",\n"
"            \"Hold at 4.2V until C/50\",\n"
"        )\n"
"    ]\n"
")\n"
"sim = pybamm.Simulation(spm, experiment=experiment, "
"parameter_values=parameter_values)\n"
"sol = sim.solve()"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/simulations_and_experiments/simulating-long-experiments.ipynb:157
msgid ""
"Alternatively, we can simulate many CCCV cycles. Here we simulate either 100 "
"cycles or until the capacity is 80% of the initial capacity, whichever is "
"first. The capacity is calculated by the eSOH model"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/simulations_and_experiments/simulating-long-experiments.ipynb:-1
msgid "[5]:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/simulations_and_experiments/simulating-long-experiments.ipynb:-1
msgid ""
"experiment = pybamm.Experiment(\n"
"    [\n"
"        (\n"
"            \"Discharge at 1C until 3V\",\n"
"            \"Rest for 1 hour\",\n"
"            \"Charge at 1C until 4.2V\",\n"
"            \"Hold at 4.2V until C/50\",\n"
"        )\n"
"    ]\n"
"    * 100,\n"
"    termination=\"80% capacity\",\n"
")\n"
"sim = pybamm.Simulation(spm, experiment=experiment, "
"parameter_values=parameter_values)\n"
"sol = sim.solve()"
msgstr ""

